    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23693" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖμα φέρων Δαναοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.682
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρένα δείματι πάλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					153
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἔλαβέ τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.74
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς δ. πεσεῖν, ἐν δείματι
				κατεστάναι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				8.118
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				36
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάρσος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				16.3
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				636
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόβοι καὶ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.80
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.22
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>object of fear, terror,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ πῦρ σὺ καὶ πᾶν δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					927
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δ. του νυκτέρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					410
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπάλοις δ.</span>
			<i>a terror</i> to them, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				343
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Germa</span>): esp. in pl.,<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				691
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				524
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.735
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειμάτων ἄχη</span>
			<i>fearful</i> plagues or monsters, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				586
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. θηρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					700
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
